    <string name="label_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="desc_app">Field calculator for shotcrete operations: pump flow rate, additive/accelerator dosage, verification against the display, dosing pump potentiometer position, and survey records with photos.</string>
    <string name="credit_hecho_por">Made by Hans Barrera</string>
    <string name="section_privacidad">Privacy and security</string>
    <string name="desc_privacidad">• The app works 100% offline: it does not require or request Internet permission.\n• It does not include ads, trackers, or third-party libraries beyond the official Android ones.\n• It does not send, receive, or store data outside this device.\n• The camera permission is used only to take photos for the survey record; photos are stored locally and only shared if you explicitly do so with the "Export and share" option.\n• The full source code is available for review.</string>

